A26D61C"}, {"file_name": "YES3.png", "id": "25662881226690906", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75520122_25662881230024239_6299176207333418075_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lfbPZeLjXQAQ7kNvwF161gd&_nc_oc=AdouIWt4XADJzI5U-azrGnkOkjeF9YI0ncwwN379wkFB_HCNasA7bdAcpPh3IfLLwCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af970r912_eXlYt2fK0UZQO7WiKaD2j-afosMvvvyQhiEA&oe=6A26BB72"}, {"file_name": "YES4.png", "id": "1354074085262388", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974741_1354074088595721_9212956591605280011_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oLSTd1KDgJcQ7kNvwF7oVbv&_nc_oc=Adri5gFadRRQHKGtnwEyS3HxZO7aT3kd3t-0wwLMWTpgIvRZpLDct-nFTdrSy0E8-Gw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8_O7Zvkre2uq4PZQEdCqlvY4VKWQYuUvn7BqnxsczHAg&oe=6A26C800"}, {"file_name": "YES5.png", "id": "1433907864677225", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974905_1433907868010558_5661496313997694104_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t1qAVSNBQaMQ7kNvwE3dU1r&_nc_oc=AdocQVI3SkaEwwPgp0nSVQawrXOkwsbS3D8-syAl1krMec3YdbqdIM2Cz0KjaGw7ymg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af99rPU-npsDlw3I-t-Rd8E9p0vAoH3v_3d0ExJajPXNRQ&oe=6A26EBAF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Swivel_Creative_Landscape.png", "id": "782721247326589", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/427384304_782721250659922_2238916620449805730_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M3lC9aOUyOMQ7kNvwEWMZXz&_nc_oc=AdoGPBCRTOsS_x8EGCbQVPd9B_3dDx4Pzs7SqCmzk6_th8HtGx0Aw32jHxvULp4jE4I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-zOicOG6kcqo2sgt17x8UhTf4OIKdH19VDXXO0aA5eLA&oe=6A26EABD"}, "display_name": "Swivel", "keywords": ["spin", "ride", "rhythmic", "fitness", "seated"], "long_description": "Swivel is a VR ride through outer space that's jam-packed with music, movement, and excitement.\n\nIn this first-of-its-kind outer space experience, you swivel your way down a cosmic track straight to the dance floor. \n\nWhile you\u2019re swiveling, get ready for a hands-on party - drumming, popping bubbles, opening doors, high-fiving aliens, and collecting music notes.\n\nThe beats? Crafted by the legendary Barry Leitch, these tunes groove with the story and your every move. There are 8 tracks, each with its own style:\n- Fly - pop\n- Love me and leave me- 50s soul\n- Sweet tooth - pop dance\n- Sputnik - dubstep\n- Spin - light metal\n- Winter - classical\n- Wally Beben - retro\n- Ennio Morricone - western\n\nSome rides are swivel-heavy, so be prepared for some serious spinning action. And guess what? There are also secret paths to up the fun factor!\n\n\u2013 Important note \u2013\nPlease take your time easing into the game. After a few days of play, our bodies adjust, and spinning becomes incredibly enjoyable \u2013 it's like tapping into our inner child. \n\n\u2013 Seated game with a minimum play space of 6.5 feet by 6.5 feet \u2013\nSwivel is a seated game that involves turning and making cool moves. Ensure you have at least 3.3ft (1m) of space in all directions.\n\nWe recommend using a \u2018swivel\u2019 chair to make those tricky turns a blast!", "short_description": "Swivel is a VR ride through outer space that's jam-packed with music, movement, and excitement."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.swivelvr.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Dimensional Dilemma", "support_website_url": "https://www.swivelvr.com/contact-us", "website_url": "http://www.swivelvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": []